    "ratingCount": "250"
  },
  "review": {
    "@type": "Review",
    "name": "A Fantastic Day Trip to Morocco from Malaga",
    "reviewBody": "We had a FANTASTIC DAY! I can not say enough nice things about Abu and Rheita ( I know I am spelling that wrong, he was the driver) Abu was so knowledgeable, friendly, and shared so much with us. He put up with our hundreds of questions and answered them all. The entire day was very smooth from the ride to the train and return. I know I asked so many questions, not ever being in Morocco I wanted to be complete (I have been to some countries where it did not work out well). The experience was wonderful, and the three kids (adult kids) had an experience they will never forget.",
    "author": {"@type": "Person", "name": "Donna Hankins"},
    "publisher": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Moha"}
  }
}

