  "description": "If you’re looking to add an unforgettable cultural twist to your holiday in southern Spain, our private Rota to Morocco day trip is your perfect escape. This immersive experience takes you from the calm shores of Rota to the exotic rhythms of Tangier in just one day. Cross the Strait of Gibraltar in comfort and step into the charm of Moroccan heritage—guided by locals who know every secret alley, story, and scent of this North African gem.",
