  "@type": "Product", 
  "name": "Tangier to Chefchaouen Day Trip",
  "image": "https://www.tangierexcursions.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/slide-3.jpg",
  "description": "This well-crafted Tangier to Chefchaouen Day Trip offers an excellent opportunity to experience the real Moroccan hospitality while enjoying the breathtaking views of this magical little town. This beautiful blue city has a rich history and has been successfully able to attract visitors from all over the world who easily fall in love with its immense beauty.",
