  },
  "review": {
    "@type": "Review",
    "name": "Chihiro Isozaki",
    "reviewBody": "Our driver, Youssef, from Tangier to Chefchaouen was lovely, personable & friendly. He came exactly at 9 am on the dot to pick us up at our Riad. The car was clean, nice and spacey, which was great for the long trip to Chefchaouen. Our guide Mohamed was very nice, polite & informative. I highly recommend Tangier Excursions!.",
